meta {
  name: Feedback List
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/feedback/list?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
}

headers {
  Accept-Language: oz
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.getStatus() === 200 && res.body && res.body.items && res.body.items.length) {
    bru.setEnvVar("feedbackId", res.body.items[0].id);
  }
}

docs {
  Admin ro'yxati — eng yangi murojaat yuqorida (`created_at DESC`).

  Har bir element:

  | Maydon | Nima |
  |---|---|
  | `id` | murojaat ID |
  | `branch_id` | qaysi filial (`0` = filial tanlanmagan) |
  | `branch_title` | **shu filialning nomi** — `Accept-Language` bo'yicha |
  | `full_name` | murojaat qilgan shaxs |
  | `created_at` | qachon yuborilgan |

  `branch_title` filiallar jadvalidan LEFT JOIN bilan olinadi, shuning uchun
  admin qaysi filialga murojaat kelganini ro'yxatdan turib ko'radi.
  Filial o'chirilgan yoki tanlanmagan bo'lsa `branch_title` bo'sh satr.

  To'liq matn (`message`, `email`, `phone`) uchun Detail so'rovidan foydalaning.
  Ruxsat: `admin` va `superadmin`.
}
